# The site's preview build only (`npm run deploy:site-preview`, Vite's
# "preview" mode, which takes .env.production's addresses where this has
# none): the accounts Worker at its workers.dev address, which works before
# its Custom Domain is set up, and the preview's own rooms Worker
# (rooms-worker/wrangler.preview.jsonc), which speaks this branch's room
# protocol while production's rooms speak the released one. Not a secret.
VITE_ROOMS_URL=wss://ba-heardle-rooms-preview.shinrunner1st.workers.dev
VITE_ACCOUNTS_URL=https://ba-heardle-accounts.shinrunner1st.workers.dev
